  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "D891B15F415C18BB",
      "text": "洛托洛托洛托洛托……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "BDF6BAD267EEA991",
      "text": "……你搞定看门的了？[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "BDF6B7D267EEA478",
      "text": "盘踞在那个基地的是\\n天星队毒帮班……\\r\\n策星小队。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "BDF6B8D267EEA62B",
      "text": "老大秋明手艺精湛，\\n负责服饰方面。\\r\\n是个有点……别具一格的男人。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "BDF6BDD267EEAEAA",
      "text": "他的行动无法预测……[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "BDF6BED267EEB05D",
      "text": "虽然不清楚面对我们的宣战\\n他将如何前来应战……[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "BDF6BBD267EEAB44",
      "text": "总之你要在秋明出现之前，\\n尽可能地削减天星队的宝可梦。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "BDF6BCD267EEACF7",
      "text": "[EMPTY 14]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "000E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_020_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "BDF6B1D267EE9A46",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n就敲响锣展开大作战！\\r\\n去踢了策星小队的场吧。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
